# Netlify rewrite rules.
#
# The site is a single-page app, so there is no file at /demo. Without this,
# Netlify serves its own 404 before React ever loads and the demo link handed to
# judges is dead — which is exactly what /demo, /login and /organize were all
# doing on this host before.
#
# 200, not 301: a rewrite serves index.html while keeping /demo in the address
# bar. A redirect would bounce the visitor to / and lose the route.
/*    /index.html   200
